    "goal": "Extrude bioink through a UV-5 (300 µm) nozzle along a 45241 µm G-code path at 58.46 mm/min to fill a 7474 µm-wide footprint at 419 µm line pitch, and report fill lines and deposition rate.",
    "rationale": "Pure bioprinting deposition calculation. The UV-5 nozzle has a 300 µm inner diameter; the extrusion volume over the 45241 µm path is computed from the nozzle cross-section × path length. Print time is path length ÷ feed rate (58.46 mm/min). Deposition rate is extrusion volume ÷ print time. Fill lines = ceil(footprint width / line pitch) = ceil(7474/419) = 18 lines. Ink density 0.963 g/cm³ is provided for mass conversion but is not needed for the volumetric nL/min rate.",
